;Considerações importantes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; class=&quot;WaaZC&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(10, 10, 10); animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none !important;&quot; class=&quot;RJPOee EIJn2&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; line-height: 24px; padding-inline-start: 16px;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwj7iuOyscCQAxUpBLkGHYO-OPkQm_YKegQIORAB&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CDkQAQ&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 4px; list-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; border-bottom: none;&quot; data-il=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;zMgcWd dSKvsb&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-crb-p=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;xFTqob&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 24px; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 4px; transition: transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1); display: inline;&quot; class=&quot;Gur8Ad&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-huuid=&quot;18074277471472599572&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cuidado com dados nominais:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(10, 10, 10); line-height: 24px; display: inline;&quot; class=&quot;vM0jzc&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-huuid=&quot;18074277471472599151&quot;&gt;O Label Encoding não é adequado para dados nominais (onde não há relação de ordem), como &quot;cores&quot;, pois a atribuição de números pode criar uma ordem artificial e prejudicar o modelo.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-huuid=&quot;18074277471472602826&quot;&gt;Nesses casos, outras técnicas como a codificação&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration-thickness: 8%; text-decoration-style: dotted; text-decoration-color: rgb(94, 94, 94); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); text-underline-offset: 10%; text-decoration-