mportant;&quot; class=&quot;d3o3Ad Hkv2Pe&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex; height: unset; rotate: 135deg;&quot; class=&quot;iPjmzb Sorfoc gNGSDf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; fill: currentcolor; height: 18px; line-height: 18px; position: relative; width: 18px;&quot; class=&quot;z1asCe Sb7k4e&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 4px; list-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 8px; border-bottom: none;&quot; data-il=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;zMgcWd dSKvsb&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-crb-p=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;xFTqob&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 24px; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 4px; transition: transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1); display: inline;&quot; class=&quot;Gur8Ad&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-huuid=&quot;18074277471472601984&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uso para alvos:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(10, 10, 10); line-height: 24px; display: inline;&quot; class=&quot;vM0jzc&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-huuid=&quot;18074277471472601563&quot;&gt;É recomendado usar o Label Encoding principalmente para a variável alvo (y) e não para as variáveis de entrada (X), conforme recomendado pelo Scikit-learn.&lt;span data-cid=&quot;2e63a460-680b-4433-b3e8-287c0d2e51b2&quot; class=&quot;pjBG2e&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot; class=&quot;UV3uM&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;One-Hot Encoding:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ordinal Encoding:&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1980" y="560" width="1260" height="930" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
